"Evul-art'h is Stuart's older sister, a knight titled Twenty-seven Hundred and Sixty-third General."
"She looks young, with short dark hair and pale pink eyes."
"She smokes a charcoal-gray cigar that puffs bright blue smoke rings."
"She likes hitting things to watch them vaporize, and calls her brother Baby Stu."
"She video-called Alden Thorn to check he was not taking advantage of Stuart."
